  "description": "\"My twin sister, who abandoned me twenty years ago, returned with a perfect life\". Mi-Jeong, a single mother, works as a cleaner. Her sister became a successful artist. Mi-Jeong begins to desire her sister's life.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=839509), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12659838)\n\n**Official Translations:**      \n[Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/drama/strangers-daughters/list?title_no=8453), [S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/SUSPENSE/nvermen/list?title_no=2815), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004010), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/drama/the-daughters/list?title_no=9793)",
